'' THE ARITIES fbc ACCEPTS are not refused -- see ctor-arg-count.test. A defaulted
'' parameter left out, each member of an overload set, 'new T( ... )', and 'S( s0 )' through
'' the IMPLICIT copy constructor a string field gives S, which the symbol table does not
'' hold. fbc-modern 1.20 prints ' 3 6 6 7 6 12', 2026-10-03.
